# Signing keystores — never commit. Keep the .jks OUTSIDE the repo; secrets live in local.properties.
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties

# ...but Room's exported schemas are the migration-test baseline and must be tracked.
!app/schemas/
!app/schemas/**/*.json

# ...and the bundled exercise catalog is a required app asset (free-exercise-db, ~1MB), not a secret.
!app/src/main/assets/exercises.json

# ...and the bundled common-foods catalog is a required app asset (nutrition seed), not a secret.
!app/src/main/assets/common_foods.json

